case_names: VACASK keeps case, ngspice folds it: nodes OUT and out are two nodes (2 V and 1.5 V), and resistors R1 and r1 two elements; the ngspice text must keep them apart
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=3.0
R1 (in OUT) resistor r=1k
R2 (OUT 0) resistor r=2k
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
r2 (out 0) resistor r=1k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
